# With origin mode (DECOM) set, the home position is the scrolling
# region's top left. CUP, VPA and VPR count rows from the region's top
# and stay inside it, and DSR 6 reports the row from the region's top.
# Setting and resetting the mode moves the cursor to the home position.
# spec: the VT100 User Guide, DECOM and CPR; the VT510 manual, DECOM
# covers: DEC-6
size 10 8
send "\e[3;6r"
send "\e[?6h"
dump state
send "\e[2;2HX"
dump state
send "\e[99;1HY"
dump state
send "\e[H\e[5d"
dump state
send "\e[H\e[e"
dump state
send "\e[2;3H\e[4G"
dump state
send "\e[6n"
send "\e[?6l"
dump state
send "\e[2;2HZ"
dump state
